  "_about": "Rally cluster, generated by design/gen_rally.py (edit that and regenerate): a segmented rev arc sweeping across the top under the hood's curve (white, rally yellow from the shift zone, red and flashing at the redline), a huge gear in the middle (red at the shift point) with the speed under it, a G-meter on the left (the dot at the lateral and longitudinal g, a ring at the peak of the last 3 s; flipX / flipY if the car's signs run the other way), boost with a peak-hold bar and two readout slots on the right. Clear of BMW's black box and belt light. No map window. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
